   <section xreflabel="PromiseRxInvoker"
            role="class"
            xml:id="org.osgi.service.jakartars.client.PromiseRxInvoker">
      <title>public interface PromiseRxInvoker<?line-break?> extends RxInvoker&lt;Promise&gt;</title>
      <para>
A specialization of the RxInvoker which creates <link linkend="org.osgi.util.promise.Promise">Promise</link>
 instances.
 </para>
      <para>
 Bundles may obtain an instance of a <link linkend="org.osgi.service.jakartars.client.PromiseRxInvoker">PromiseRxInvoker</link> using a
 ClientBuilder obtained from the service registry and calling the
 jakarta.ws.rs.client.Invocation.Builder.rx(Class) method.</para>
      <formalpara role="parameter">
         <title>Provider Type</title>
         <para>Consumers of this API must not implement this type</para>
      </formalpara>
